<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani cotton yarn rates close higher.</title>
<headline>Pakistani cotton yarn rates close higher.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-12-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistani cotton yarn rates closed higher on Sunday after yarn prices rose on international markets, dealers said. Rates were likely to post fresh gains in the next few days, one dealer said.</p>
<p>Following are the rates in rupees supplied by the Pakistan Yarn Merchants Association for a 10-lb (4.54 kg) cone of 21 counts:			    Sun	   Dec 4</p>
<p>    Al-Karam		     500	   485</p>
<p>    Globe			  500	   490</p>
<p>    MGM			    490	   480</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
